# F(x)tec Pro1X (sourced by Xsession-post): mce, which runs as root, may
# use this X server. Its x11-ctrl module switches the display off through
# DPMS and the input devices off with it; without the server's cookie
# (Xorg -auth, the session user's) XOpenDisplay() failed, and the display
# stayed on when mce had blanked it.
xhost +si:localuser:root > /dev/null 2>&1
